    "body": "I think I know these problems, they occur especially with short sentences. It will not be possible to eliminate this, as this artificial separation is not intended. But not all voices are equally vulnerable to this, e.g. af_heart seems to be more stable. Interesting to hear that the sweet spot is at 160 characters. I can recommend the separation always only after the characters .!? to make.",
