    "created_at": "2026-02-14T17:33:13Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-02-14T17:33:13Z",
    "body": "yeah chunking is the crux, ive been noticing too.\nso i read somewhere online about maximums of 500 tokens (where ~4characters = 1 token in english) but that just wasnt true, much too high.\ngenerating i noticed that chunks / clips would always be max 29/30 seconds each. \nso yeah, similar to above now im keeping most chunks between 40 and 80, with max of 110 which is something like 25s\n\nalso for anyone, i was getting weird issues with faulty generations on `fp16` model. its better on `fp32` now\n\nmight be worth adding some chunking funcitons here rather than everyone implementing their own 😅 ",
